<title>HUNGARY: TABLE - Hungary May ind output down 1.6 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hungary May ind output down 1.6 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output in May fell 1.6 percent from April, but was up by 1.9 percent from May 1996, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The KSH added that the industrial output in the first five months of the year was 5.9 percent up from the same period of 1996.</p>
